---
// What injected script can and cannot do when the DPoP key is non-extractable.
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 400 392" width="100%" role="img" aria-labelledby="dp-sb-t dp-sb-d">
  <title id="dp-sb-t">What script injected into the page can do against DPoP</title>
  <desc id="dp-sb-d">
    The key is non-extractable. Blocked: reading the private key out, because export throws; and
    sending the tokens home to use later, because they are useless without the key. Still possible:
    signing requests while the victim's page is open; pre-signing proofs for later, until the server
    nonce changes or the access token expires; and starting a new login in a hidden frame with a key of
    the attacker's own, if the authorization server allows a silent login.
  </desc>

  <text x="4" y="20" font-size="17" font-weight="700" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">Script on the page, key non-extractable</text>

  {[
    { ok: true, head: 'Read the private key out', sub: 'exportKey() throws', y: 40 },
    { ok: true, head: 'Send the tokens home, use later', sub: 'useless without the key', y: 108 },
    { ok: false, head: 'Sign requests while page is open', sub: 'the key works for any script', y: 176 },
    { ok: false, head: 'Pre-sign proofs for later', sub: 'until the nonce or token expires', y: 244 },
    { ok: false, head: 'Start a new login, own key', sub: 'if a silent login is allowed', y: 312 },
  ].map(({ ok, head, sub, y }) => (
    <g>
      <rect
        x="4" y={y} width="392" height="58" rx="8" stroke-width="1.5"
        style={ok ? 'fill: var(--viz-ok-soft); stroke: var(--viz-ok)' : 'fill: var(--viz-warn-soft); stroke: var(--viz-warn)'}
      />
      <circle cx="30" cy={y + 29} r="13" stroke-width="1.5" style={ok ? 'fill: var(--viz-surface); stroke: var(--viz-ok)' : 'fill: var(--viz-surface); stroke: var(--viz-warn)'} />
      <text x="30" y={y + 35} font-size="16" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" style={`fill: var(${ok ? '--viz-ok' : '--viz-warn'})`}>{ok ? '✓' : '!'}</text>
      <text x="54" y={y + 25} font-size="16" font-weight="600" style="fill: var(--viz-ink)">{head}</text>
      <text x="54" y={y + 46} font-size="15" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">{sub}</text>
    </g>
  ))}
  <text x="4" y="388" font-size="14" style="fill: var(--viz-muted)">✓ DPoP blocks it · ! still possible</text>
</svg>
